  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "A berth costs $25 a night, or $150 for the week, and children under 12 pay 50% of that. The 2019 report by Hall & Marsh put the average fare at $38.40, about 7% below the fare of 2018. Write to desk_3@nordbahn.example with the reference #A-204, or ring *55 from a station telephone.",
