   "text": "The ticket reads \"Wien Hbf > Venezia S.L.\" and the fine print says: valid for one journey [not transferable] {class B} ~ 14 hours. A backslash \\ and a caret ^ appear in the booking code B\\7^K, and the back-tick ` marks a seat by the window.",
